{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "spanish", "appid": 924970, "month": "2022-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1667260800, "end_date": 1667951999, "month_true_total": 55, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:12:22 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "125172751", "author": {"steamid": "76561199260244229", "personaname": "diego511.dm", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199260244229/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 4315, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2425, "last_played": 1733713458, "avatar": "8a3629a5f64d22e7a9bfa87d3da61397a20dc9d4"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "EXELENTE JUEGO PARA PASAR EL RATOS CON AMIGOS 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1667944729, "timestamp_updated": 1667944729, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "125148873", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987087070", "personaname": "SantiSanTV", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mininodanty/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 724, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 716, "last_played": 1667933074, "avatar": "7c36e06896bbac0c5d75752f15eae2a8aab682f2"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Soy fan de los L4D y participé en la beta de B4B, aún siendo muy \"parecido\" tiene algo que no me acaba de encajar, no sé lo que es pero me aburre más de lo que entretiene. Además apenas hay gente para los pairings online y la mitad de las veces terminas jugando con bots.\n\nSolo merece la pena si vas a jugarlo con otros 3 amigos y se compra a buen precio (<5 €)", "timestamp_created": 1667909203, "timestamp_updated": 1667909203, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493823349475860596", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "125099244", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045535480", "personaname": "MisterSmile_", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198045535480/", "num_games_owned": 1103, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 3599, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2145, "last_played": 1670789873, "avatar": "c95b4afa692842f3540c553210f675bce8553cf4"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Me está gustando bastante. No es un Left 4 Dead que es la premisa con la que viene mucha gente a jugarlo, es un shooter con elementos de ese juego, pero con Deck building, builds de personajes, sinergias de equipo, rarezas de armas, personalización de personajes, runs de farmeo para conseguir mas cartas..etc. Lo que menos destaca es en la historia y en el PVP, pero por lo demás, si lo conseguís de oferta, muy recomendado.", "timestamp_created": 1667825512, "timestamp_updated": 1667825512, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.598283886909484863", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "125083978", "author": {"steamid": "76561198082330575", "personaname": "GOWU666", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198082330575/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 19824, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 533, "playtime_at_review": 2878, "last_played": 1787986618, "avatar": "48e5d0f9da7dd53ec013e256297655cb20b9399e"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "excelente juego! xD", "timestamp_created": 1667790659, "timestamp_updated": 1667790659, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "125075712", "author": {"steamid": "76561198142574373", "personaname": "Fx | $ANITY", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FxSanity/", "num_games_owned": 274, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 3241, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2448, "last_played": 1699482406, "avatar": "8316252d1f71e5bc5ae978609e2b2378872da644"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "yes\n\nActualizo: El juego va a dejar de tener soporte y no van a meter mas dlcs porque los creadores se van a dedicar a otro juego. Asi que si lo queres comprar te recomiendo comprarlo cuando este a un 60-70%, no vale la pena el precio normal.", "timestamp_created": 1667776397, "timestamp_updated": 1675672748, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.485294133424758911", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}